/LC7 {1 0.3 0} def
/LC8 {0.5 0.5 0.5} def
% Default dash patterns (version 5.0)
/LTB {BL [] LCb DL} def
/LTw {PL [] 1 setgray} def
/LTb {PL [] LCb DL} def
